{"id":"16-2985-2-2","zh":"以 s 结尾的词根","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-2986-2-4","zh":"pusa，义为滋养。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-2986-5-8","zh":"poseti、posayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-2986-9-41","zh":"这些词形虽然看起来像是依据 bhūvādi 类的 “poseti” 这一词形而成的使役主动形，但由于可以见到 “aññepi devo poseti”（天神也滋养其他众生）等 curādi 类的词形，应当知道它们是按单纯主动的意义来说的。","confidence":70}
{"id":"16-2986-42-55","zh":"而在两者的使役用法中，应当采用 “posāpeti、posāpayati” 这样的使役主动形。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-2987-2-4","zh":"pesa，义为遣送。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-2987-5-8","zh":"peseti、pesayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-2988-2-4","zh":"pisa，义为有力与存活。","confidence":60}
{"id":"16-2988-5-8","zh":"piseti、pisayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-2989-2-4","zh":"pasi，义为毁灭。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-2989-5-8","zh":"paṃseti、paṃsayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-2990-2-4","zh":"jasi，义为守护。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-2990-5-8","zh":"jaṃseti、jaṃsayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-2991-2-4","zh":"silesa，义为粘合。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-2991-5-8","zh":"sileseti、silesayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-2991-9-10","zh":"sileso（粘合）。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-2992-2-4","zh":"lūsa，义为伤害。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-2992-5-8","zh":"lūseti、lūsayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-2993-2-4","zh":"punsa，义为压制。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-2993-5-8","zh":"其中的 n 字代表鼻音（niggahīta）。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-2993-9-12","zh":"puṃseti、puṃsayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-2993-13-14","zh":"napuṃsako（黄门）。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-2993-15-26","zh":"词根的 n 字脱落时，也有 “poso”（人）这一词形。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-2994-2-8","zh":"这里所说的 na**puṃsako**，是指既没有女性体相、也没有男性体相的人。","confidence":70}
{"id":"16-2994-9-25","zh":"因为他不能像男子那样强有力地压制敌人，没有能力去摧伏他们，所以称为**napuṃsako**。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-2994-26-41","zh":"但也有人说，napuṃsaka 的词义是 “不是男人，也不是女人”。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-2994-42-50","zh":"所以精通语法学的人按照中性的词性，把这种人称为 napuṃsaka。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-2995-2-4","zh":"dhūsa，义为使有光彩。","confidence":65}
{"id":"16-2995-5-8","zh":"dhūseti、dhūsayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-2996-2-4","zh":"rusa，义为激怒。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-2996-5-7","zh":"rosana 就是使人发怒。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-2996-8-11","zh":"roseti、rosayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-2996-12-13","zh":"roso（忿怒）。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-2996-14-17","zh":"**roso** 就是愤怒。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-2997-2-4","zh":"byusa，义为舍弃。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-2997-5-8","zh":"byoseti、byosayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-2998-2-4","zh":"jasa，义为伤害。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-2998-5-8","zh":"jāseti、jāsayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-2999-2-4","zh":"daṃsa，义为咬。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-2999-5-8","zh":"daṃseti、daṃsayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-2999-9-10","zh":"daṃsano（牙齿）。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-2999-11-14","zh":"**daṃsano** 就是牙齿。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-2999-15-22","zh":"人们用它来咬嚼硬食或软食，所以叫做 daṃsano。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-3000-2-5","zh":"dasi，也有显示的意思。","confidence":70}
{"id":"16-3000-6-10","zh":"ca 字承接前面的 “咬” 义。","confidence":65}
{"id":"16-3000-11-14","zh":"daṃseti、daṃsayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-3000-15-20","zh":"vidaṃseti、vidaṃsayati：太阳显现光明。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-3001-2-4","zh":"tassa，义为恐吓。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-3001-5-10","zh":"tasseti、tassayati：这个人恐吓盗贼。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-3002-2-4","zh":"vassu，义为凝聚能力。","confidence":60}
{"id":"16-3002-5-7","zh":"凝聚能力，就是使之具有能力。","confidence":65}
{"id":"16-3002-8-11","zh":"vasseti、vassayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-3003-2-4","zh":"jasa，义为打击。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-3003-5-7","zh":"打击就是捶打。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-3003-8-11","zh":"jāseti、jāsayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-3004-2-4","zh":"pasa，义为捆绑。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-3004-5-8","zh":"pāseti、pāsayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-3004-9-10","zh":"pāso（套索）。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-3004-11-18","zh":"人们用它来捆绑众生，所以叫做 pāso，例如捕鸟的套索等。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-3005-2-4","zh":"ghusi，义为发出声音。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-3005-5-7","zh":"发出声音就是高声宣告。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-3005-8-11","zh":"ghoseti、ghosayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-3005-12-13","zh":"ghoso（声音）。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-3006-2-4","zh":"lasa，义为施展技艺。","confidence":60}
{"id":"16-3006-5-9","zh":"施展技艺，就是 lāsiya 舞，也就是表演戏剧、作回旋的舞姿。","confidence":55}
{"id":"16-3006-10-13","zh":"lāseti、lāsayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-3006-14-18","zh":"lāsento、lāsentī。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-3006-19-34","zh":"这里有这样一段巴利：“奏乐的女子们也起舞，跳舞的女子们也起舞，起舞的女子们也跳舞。”","confidence":60}
{"id":"16-3006-35-47","zh":"其中，**lāsentī** 是指那些像腾跃一样起身、表演 lāsiya 戏剧、作回旋舞姿的女子。","confidence":60}
{"id":"16-3007-2-4","zh":"bhūsa，义为装饰。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-3007-5-8","zh":"bhūseti、bhūsayati。","confidence":90}
