{"id":"16-3007-13-16","zh":"bhūsanaṃ、vibhūsanaṃ（装饰）。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-3008-2-4","zh":"vasa，义为涂油、切割与盗取。","confidence":70}
{"id":"16-3008-5-8","zh":"盗取，就是以偷窃的方式拿取。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-3008-9-12","zh":"vāseti、vāsayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-3008-13-14","zh":"vasā（脂肪）。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-3009-2-4","zh":"tāsa，义为阻挡。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-3009-5-7","zh":"阻挡就是阻止。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-3009-8-11","zh":"tāseti、tāsayati。","confidence":90}
